arg bodyLengthCall request request
run bodyLengthCall
bind bodyLength CByteCount bodyLengthCall
call largeBodyCheckCall math.greaterThanOrEqualI64
arg largeBodyCheckCall left bodyLength
arg largeBodyCheckCall right largeBodyThreshold
run largeBodyCheckCall
bind isLargeBody Bool largeBodyCheckCall
branchIf isLargeBody writeLargeBody

